The focused window's title centred on the screen, instead of starting
after the layout symbol, which on the 3440px monitor left most of the bar
empty. A title that would run into the status shifts left, and one too
long for either starts after the layout symbol as before; the marker of a
floating window stays at the title's top left. Upstream's
centeredwindowname patch, which puts the text half its padding off centre
and guards only the left edge.

